# GPU GRES mapping for laboratory node gpu01.
# Install as gres.conf on hosts that advertise GPUs (at least gpu01).
# File is typically ignored on CPU-only nodes.
#
# Confirm device indices with: nvidia-smi -L
# AutoDetect=nvml is available on some Slurm builds; explicit File= is clearer for labs.

NodeName=gpu01 Name=gpu File=/dev/nvidia0
